# The keys of a Hammerspoon theme file, each pointing at a role from theme/VOCABULARY. The
# left hand names are the ten the kit reads from a file under .hammerspoon/config/themes, a
# colour for the row text, the surface and the preview pane, and they are the kit's own
# words rather than anything Hammerspoon defines.
#
# text is the ink, subtext is the ink stepped back, background and border are the shared
# surface, and accent is the preview body text, which is the ink as well. meta is the preview
# metadata, path is the preview path and note is the preview note. highlight is the bar under
# the list cursor and selection is the tint under a selected span.
text       = foreground
subtext    = subtext
background = background
border     = dim
accent     = foreground
meta       = overlay
path       = comment
note       = tertiary
highlight  = highlight
selection  = selection
